        // Step 1: Extract evens (2k) and odds (2k+1) into separate half-tensors
        //   Evens: x_even[k] = x[2k]
        //   Odds:  x_odd[k]  = x[2k+1]
        //
        // Since we can't easily do UB-to-UB strided copy, we do scalar GetValue/SetValue
